WEBVTT

00:00:29.277 --> 00:00:32.495
I'm sure you'll hear every mistake I make."

00:00:32.495 --> 00:00:36.553
And then they stop talking. (Laughter)

00:00:36.553 --> 00:00:38.950
And they wait for me to go away

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:41.187
and talk to someone else.

00:00:41.187 --> 00:00:43.222
The other set of people,

00:00:43.222 --> 00:00:45.647
their eyes light up,

00:00:45.647 --> 00:00:46.878
and they say,

00:00:46.878 --> 00:00:51.187
"You are just the person I want to talk to."

00:00:51.187 --> 00:00:53.607
And then they tell me about whatever it is

00:00:53.607 --> 00:00:56.142
they think is going wrong with the English language.

00:00:56.142 --> 00:00:58.511
(Laughter)

00:00:58.511 --> 00:01:00.828
